#ASSERT `s 555(2) the company has delivered the return of the allotment in time` (JUST FALSE) (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 15 1 2026) (Date 15 2 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 555(2) the company has delivered the return of the allotment in time` NOTHING (Date 15 2 2026) (Date 15 1 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
