#ASSERT `s 555(2) the company has delivered the return of the allotment in time` (JUST TRUE) (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 31 1 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 556(2) the company has delivered the return of the allotment in time` (JUST TRUE) (Date 15 2 2026) (Date 15 1 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 556(2) the company has delivered the return of the allotment in time` (JUST TRUE) (Date 16 2 2026) (Date 15 1 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 556(2) the company has delivered the return of the allotment in time` (JUST FALSE) (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 15 1 2026) (Date 16 2 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 556(2) the company has delivered the return of the allotment in time` (JUST FALSE) (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 15 1 2026) (Date 15 2 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
