#ASSERT `s 557(3)(b) the court may make an order extending the time for delivery` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 559: the provisions of Chapter 2 have no application to the shares the subscribers take on formation.
#ASSERT `s 559 the provisions of Chapter 2 apply to the taking of the shares` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 559 the provisions of Chapter 2 apply to the taking of the shares` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
